          "who": "greeter",
          "text": "Signed, sealed and iron rank. The second floor is open to you, and Bel will stop looking at you like that."
        },
        {
          "who": "greeter",
          "text": "Take something small first. The board up there is never empty and it forgives a great deal."
        }
      ],
