          "text": "Iron floor. Nine on the board this morning and there will be nine tomorrow. They will not be the same nine."
        },
        {
          "who": "clerk_iron",
          "text": "Name at the bottom, date at the top, and the sheet comes back to me either way. Especially the ones that went wrong."
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
